"P3778157161" "Note"
// DetailString :
"P3013868482" "You found this note on one of the Freaks you defeated. It reads:<br><br>'{PERSON_NAME} will be made to complete the new sonic wave projector. See to it that he learns not to keep me waiting.'<br><br> There is also an address on the note. It is signed, 'Clamor.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - InventorStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P958444323" "{PERSON_NAME}'s story"
// DetailString :
"P507607595" "When you rescued {PERSON_NAME}, he told you:<br><br>'I'm lucky you showed up. The Freaks have been trying to force me to perfect this sonic wave projector. I think I'd feel safer if you'd take the latest version of the device with you. I want nothing more to do with it!'"

