// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4266466755" "Sister Psyche said you would be coming by, and I have never know her to be wrong about anything. This the sonic wave projector? Hmm, it looks like it was adapted from pre-existing technology of some kind. Could be Council. But I think it more likely dates back to the Council's earlier leadership. Either way, I'm sure the Council will want it back."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4023351273" "So, that sonic wave projector was adapted from a design created by one of Requiem's many minions. Perhaps the Freakshow stole the original device from them."
// RandomFameString :
"P2399611086" "I saw {HeroName} traipsing around with some kinda crazy gizmo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P759226486" "Now we may have to worry about the Council as well as the Freakshow. The situation grows murkier."

