// Dialog :
"P1026126801" "That warehouse has not been used regularly for some time. Why would the Freaks chose to deploy their sonic device there? Another mystery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1553139305" "I've had an expert visit those buildings where the Freaks deployed their sonic devices. According to him, the walls and foundation have experienced significant stress. It seems that the Freaks' sonic devices can bring a building crashing down! You may have disrupted their tests, {HeroName}, but I am certain we have not yet seen the full scope of their plot."

