// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P925782192" "You defeated the Freakshow and the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4159767701" "It sounds as though this Clamor person stole this sonic wave technology for the Freakshow! And the Council isn't happy about it.<br><br>Perhaps we can now begin to unravel the Freaks' mysterious plan. I have no doubt they wish to use their sonic bombs for great evil."
// RandomFameString :
"P775223108" "{HeroName} jumped into the middle of a fracas between the Freakshow and Council. I bet those jerks really learned their lesson!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3697488487" "The Freaks' master, Clamor, remains at large. Fear not, {HeroName}; together we will find her and bring her to a different end than the one she is expecting."
// RandomFameString :
"P4126206028" "I gotta tell you, that {HeroName} is one tough cookie. Council and Freakshow. Forget about it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2409131154" "Clamor seems to be an important personage among the Freakshow; I think we should learn more about her connection to the Council. I know of one who might help us. His name is Robert Koslowski, and he is an expert in such matters. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Speak to Koslowski about the dangers Clamor might pose.</A> Whatever wisdom he has to share with you, use it well."
// AcceptString :
"P3894017573" "Speak to Koslowski about the dangers Clamor might pose"
// SendOffString :
"P1125395455" "The road to capturing this fiend is far from over, {HeroName}. Steel yourself for the journey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1813863672" "Speak to Robert Koslowski"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3567932722" "Robert Koslowski awaits you."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2946676108" "Eliminate {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2124893444" "I understand you want info on Clamor. I think I can help you out. <br><br>Clamor worked in research under the Council's previous leadership, until her love of havoc eventually drew her to the Freakshow. When she left, she took a lot of technology with her, technology the Council feels is rightfully theirs. They don't trust her, {HeroName}. Under the Council's old regime, she was always a wild card. Now that the Center's in charge, I'm sure he'd like nothing better than to eliminate her.<br><br>For awhile now, I've been watching the base Clamor stole her sonic technology from. If you go over there, I think you might find some more info on her agenda."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3151937454" "Defeat all soldiers in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1789731030" "You must investigate that lead Robert gave you. There is still much for us to learn."

