// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3602140907" "Naturally. We can hardly tolerate an incursion by someone like {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2318416138" "Archon Granger"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4233049197" "I don't care how many times you have been over the security system. Look at it again!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2182140650" "As if on cue! You idiots!"

