"P330148510" "I sense another confrontation between the Freakshow and the Council. This time they are located in a government office of some kind. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Defeat the Council and the Freakshow and find out what it is they seek.</A> I feel we are getting closer to learning the Freaks' plans for their sonic bombs."
// AcceptString :
"P1997920105" "Defeat the Council and Freakshow and find out what it is they seek"
// SendOffString :
"P2186520783" "I believe the office has something to do with monitoring the environment of Paragon City. There is a man there who will help you; his name is a tree of some kind."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3119951639" "That government office is still under attack by the Council and Freakshow."

