"P2068933768" "I have seen Clamor's plan, {HeroName}. She has placed her sonic bombs in several key locations that correspond to weak spots beneath Brickstown. If she is able to detonate those charges, she will turn that zone into another Faultline! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You must disable the sonic devices!</A>"
